  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Housing Programme (Sarajevo Process) - 2nd Phase 2012-2013 - allocation 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Embedded in the context of the Sarajevo Process, the Regional Housing Programme aims to make a substantial contribution to the satisfactory resolution of the protracted problem of the remaining refugees and displaced persons in Bosnia and Herzegovina, Croatia, Montenegro and Serbia by providing long-lasting, sustainable housing solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
